<TextLayout title="Proof support" description="Help with Proof, the contact-sheet app for iPhone and iPad.">
  <p>Proof creates film-style contact sheets on iPhone and iPad.</p>
  <p>To create a sheet, start a project and choose photographs from Photos or Files. Choose a layout before annotating, mark your selections, and export the finished sheet as JPEG, PNG, or PDF.</p>
  <p>If an import fails, check that the original file is available on your device or has finished downloading from its storage provider. Try importing a smaller selection to identify a problematic file.</p>
  <p>If optional support purchases are unavailable, check your internet connection and tap Retry in Settings &gt; Support. Purchases are optional one-time tips and do not change app features.</p>
  <p>For help, contact: <a href="mailto:support@schneider.kim">support@schneider.kim</a>.</p>
  <p>Include your device model, iOS or iPadOS version, Proof version, and steps to reproduce the issue. Please avoid attaching private photographs unless they are necessary to explain the problem.</p>
</TextLayout>
